    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu dituku adi mukelenge Ahashawelosha wakafila ba mu nsubu wa Hamana, muena lukuna wa Bena Yuda, kudi Esetê mukelenge mukashi. Môdekai wakalua ku mpala kua mukelenge, bualu bua Esetê wakamuambila bu muakadiye kudiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakakohola kakanu kakanyengeye kudi Hamana, wakakaha Môdekai. Esetê wakateka Môdekai ha mutu ha nsubu wa Hamana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esetê wakayikila ne mukelenge kabidi, wakahona ku makasa andi, wakamusengelela ne binsonshi ku mesu bua kukudimuneye bualu bubi buakamba Hamana, Muena Agaga, kuenzela Bena Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe mukelenge wakolola dikombo dia or kudi Esetê. Nunku Esetê wakajuka hanshi, wakimana ku mesu kua mukelenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamuambila ne, Biasua mukelenge, bingikala musangane luse ku mesu kuandi, bikala bualu buimpe ku mesu kua mukelenge, ne binasankisha mesu andi, bafunde mikanda mikuabo ya kukudimunabo nʼai mikanda yakafunda Hamana, muana wa Hamedata, Muena Agaga, yakafundeye bua kubutulabo Bena Yuda ba mu nseke yonso ya mukelenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyi mundi mua kutangila bualu bubi budi bulua kudi bantu banyi? Munyi mundi mua kutangila dibutuka dia bana betu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe mukelenge Ahashawelosha wakambila Esetê, mukelenge mukashi, ne Môdekai, Muena Yuda, ne, Monai, nakamana kufila ba mu nsubu wa Hamana kudi Esetê, bakamana kumuowa yeye ku tshiowelu bualu bua yeye wakalenga Bena Yuda ne tshianza tshiandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku nufunde bualu bua Bena Yuda bunudi basue mu dina dia mukelenge, nutekehu tshimanyinu tshia ku kakanu ka mukelenge; bualu bua kakuena muntu udi mumanye mua kukudimuna dî didi difundibua mu dina dia mukelenge, didi ne tshimanyinu tshia ku kakanu ka mukelenge tshitekahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe mu tshikondo atshi bakabikila bafundi ba mukelenge mu ngondo muisatu, ngondo wa Siwana mene, mu dituku dia makumi abidi ne asatu dia ngondo; bakafundila miloho ne ba-gouverneur ne bantu banene bakadi mu buloba bua Inde tô ne ku Atiopa, mu nseke lukama ne makumi abidi ne muanda mutekete, bantu mu tshifundilu tshiabo ne mu muaku wabo bantu mu tshifundilu tshiabo ne mu muaku wabo, malu onso akamba Môdekai bualu bua Bena Yuda; bakafundila Bena Yuda mu tshifundilu tshiabo ne mu muaku wabo kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakafunda malu au mu dina dia mukelenge Ahashawelosha, wakatekahu tshimanyinu tshia ku kakanu ka mukelenge, wakatuma mikanda ei mu bianza bia bantu badi benda ha nyima ha tubalu tudi tuenda lukasa tuakadi mu nsubu wa mukelenge tuakalelabo kudi kabalu kandi kanene; ne ha nyima ha nyama ya mpunda",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8.10:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Dî dia mu français didi",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mulet",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ne ha tumelo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu mikanda ei mukelenge wakitabusha bua Bena Yuda badisangishe ku musoko ne ku musoko ne bua kuluangana ne kushiha ne kubutula ne kujimisha bukole buonso bua bantu bakadi bakeba kubaluisha, ne bakashi babo ne bana babo bakese, ne bua kubahaula; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakadi mua kuenza nunku mu nseke yonso ya mukelenge Ahashawelosha mu difuku dia dikumi ne asatu dia ngondo wa dikumi ne ibidi, ngondo wa Adâ mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakatuma mikanda ei ya kumanyisha nʼabi bantu bonso ba mu nseke yonso ne, Budi Bena Yuda nʼabu mbua kudilongolola bua dituku adi bua kudisombuelabo kudi bena lukuna babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku bakaya ne mikanda bakadi benda ha nyima ha tubalu tuabo tuakenda lubilu tuakadi mu mudimu wa mukelenge, bakaya lukasa bendeshibue ku mukenji wa mukelenge; bakela mukenji eu mu Shushana, musoko wa mukelenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Môdekai wakumuka ku mesu kua mukelenge muluate bilulu bia bleu ne bitoke bia bukelenge, ne tshifulu tshia butumbi tshia or, ne tshikowelu tshikunzubile tshia bilulu bia lin; bena musoko bakadi mu Shushana bakela mbila, bakasanka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Yuda bakadi ne munya ne musangelu ne disanka ne butumbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu nseke yonso ne mu misoko yonso yakafika mikanda ya mukenji, Bena Yuda bakadi ne musangelu ne disanka, bakalongolola bia kudia bia disanka, bakadi ne dituku dimpe. Bantu bakuabo ba bungi ba mu buloba bakandamuka bu Bena Yuda; bualu bua ditshina dia Bena Yuda diakabakuata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
